{
  "info": {
    "name": "Waro Public API",
    "_postman_id": "waro-public-api-v1",
    "description": "API pública de Waro Colombia — autenticada con API key (`waro_sk_xxx`).\n\nFlujo de checkout completo:\n1. GET /v1/restaurant — info del restaurante\n2. GET /v1/menu — menú público (script captura product_id automáticamente)\n2.5. GET /v1/product/{product_id} — detalle con modifier_groups[] (solo si has_modifiers: true)\n3. POST /v1/cart/batch — crear carrito (incluir modifiers[] si aplica)\n4. POST /v1/otp/send — enviar OTP al email del cliente\n5. POST /v1/otp/verify — verificar OTP → guarda `customer_token` automáticamente\n6. POST /v1/cart/{cart_id}/verify — vincular cliente al carrito (usa customer_token)\n7. PUT /v1/cart/{cart_id}/delivery — asignar dirección de entrega\n8. POST /v1/cart/{cart_id}/checkout — confirmar orden\n\nVariables clave:\n- `base_url` — URL base de la API\n- `api_key` — tu API key `waro_sk_xxx`\n- `product_id`, `cart_id`, `session_id`, `customer_token`, `address_id` — se capturan automáticamente con scripts\n\n⚠️ `session_id` es generado por el backend al crear el carrito — no enviar en el body.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{api_key}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "api_key", "value": "waro_sk_CHANGE_ME", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "cart_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "session_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "customer_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "address_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "customer_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "order_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "profile_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "test_email", "value": "test@example.com", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "product_id", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🍽️ Restaurant & Menu",
      "description": "Información pública del restaurante y menú — no requiere conocer el slug.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /v1/restaurant",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/restaurant",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "restaurant"]
            },
            "description": "Retorna el perfil público del restaurante asociado al API key."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('success flag', () => pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true);",
                  "console.log('Restaurant:', json.data?.name);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /v1/menu",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/menu",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "menu"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "category_id",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "Opcional: filtrar por categoría UUID",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retorna el menú público con productos disponibles.\n\nCada producto incluye `has_modifiers: true/false`.\nEl script captura automáticamente el primer producto con has_modifiers=true en `product_id`.\nSi ninguno tiene modificadores, captura el primer producto disponible."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('success flag', () => pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true);",
                  "const products = json.data?.products || [];",
                  "const withMods = products.find(p => p.has_modifiers);",
                  "const fallback = products[0];",
                  "const chosen = withMods || fallback;",
                  "if (chosen) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('product_id', chosen.id);",
                  "  console.log('✅ product_id guardado:', chosen.id, '| has_modifiers:', chosen.has_modifiers);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /v1/product/{product_id} — Detalle + modificadores ⚡",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/product/{{product_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "product", "{{product_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Retorna el detalle completo de un producto incluyendo `modifier_groups[]`.\n\nUsar cuando `has_modifiers: true` en GET /v1/menu.\n\nRespuesta incluye:\n- `modifier_groups[]` con `is_required`, `min_qty`, `max_qty`\n- `modifiers[]` dentro de cada grupo con `id`, `name`, `price`, `is_default`\n- `is_available_online` — false = producto no disponible para domicilio\n\nUsar el `id` de cada modificador seleccionado en `modifiers[]` al crear el carrito."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('success flag', () => pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true);",
                  "const groups = json.data?.modifier_groups || [];",
                  "console.log('Modifier groups:', groups.length);",
                  "groups.forEach(g => {",
                  "  console.log(' Group:', g.name, '| required:', g.is_required, '| min:', g.min_qty, '| max:', g.max_qty);",
                  "  g.modifiers.forEach(m => console.log('   -', m.name, '$' + m.price, m.is_default ? '(default)' : ''));",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🛒 V1 Cart",
      "description": "Operaciones de carrito — el tenant_id se inyecta desde el API key, nunca se expone al caller.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/cart/batch — Crear carrito",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"order_type\": \"delivery\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"product_id\": \"{{product_id}}\",\n      \"quantity\": 1,\n      \"unit_price\": 15000,\n      \"notes\": \"Sin cebolla\",\n      \"modifiers\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"MODIFIER_UUID_DE_/v1/product/{id}\",\n          \"name\": \"Extra queso\",\n          \"price\": 2000\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"product_id\": \"{{product_id}}\",\n      \"quantity\": 1,\n      \"unit_price\": 15000,\n      \"notes\": null,\n      \"modifiers\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/cart/batch",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "cart", "batch"]
            },
            "description": "Crea un carrito con uno o más items en batch. El tenant se infiere del API key.\n\n**modifiers[]** — array de modificadores seleccionados para el item:\n- `id` — UUID del modificador (obtenido de GET /v1/product/{id} → modifier_groups[].modifiers[].id)\n- `name` — nombre del modificador (para display)\n- `price` — precio adicional del modificador\n\nSi el producto no tiene modificadores, enviar `modifiers: []`.\n\nEl mismo producto con diferente combinación de modifiers se trata como un item separado."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 or 201', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const cart = json.data || json;",
                  "const cartId = cart.id || cart.cart_id;",
                  "if (cartId) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('cart_id', cartId);",
                  "  console.log('✅ cart_id guardado:', cartId);",
                  "}",
                  "if (cart.session_id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('session_id', cart.session_id);",
                  "  console.log('✅ session_id guardado:', cart.session_id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /v1/cart/session/{session_id}",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/cart/session/{{session_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "cart", "session", "{{session_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Obtiene el carrito activo de una sesión."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.cart_id || json.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('cart_id', json.cart_id || json.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /v1/cart/{cart_id}/delivery — Actualizar entrega",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"order_type\": \"delivery\",\n  \"delivery_address_id\": \"{{address_id}}\",\n  \"scheduled_time\": null,\n  \"delivery_instructions\": \"Tocar el timbre dos veces\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/cart/{{cart_id}}/delivery",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "cart", "{{cart_id}}", "delivery"]
            },
            "description": "Actualiza el tipo de entrega y dirección del carrito."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /v1/cart/{cart_id}/items/{item_id}",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/cart/{{cart_id}}/items/ITEM_UUID_AQUI",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "cart", "{{cart_id}}", "items", "ITEM_UUID_AQUI"]
            },
            "description": "Elimina un item específico del carrito."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /v1/cart/{cart_id} — Limpiar carrito",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/cart/{{cart_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "cart", "{{cart_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Elimina todos los items del carrito."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/cart/{cart_id}/verify — Verificar sesión existente",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Customer-Token", "value": "{{customer_token}}", "description": "JWT del cliente — obtenido de /v1/otp/verify" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/cart/{{cart_id}}/verify",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "cart", "{{cart_id}}", "verify"]
            },
            "description": "Vincula el cliente autenticado al carrito. Requiere API key + customer JWT.\n\nUsar cuando el cliente ya tiene una sesión activa (no necesita OTP).\nEnviar el token obtenido de /v1/otp/verify en el header X-Customer-Token."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/cart/{cart_id}/checkout — Confirmar orden",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/cart/{{cart_id}}/checkout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "cart", "{{cart_id}}", "checkout"]
            },
            "description": "Finaliza el carrito como orden confirmada. El carrito debe haber sido verificado previamente via OTP o sesión.\n\nRetorna order_number, total_amount, order_type y pickup_pin (para pickup).\nRetorna 409 si el carrito ya fue procesado (idempotente)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.order_id) pm.collectionVariables.set('order_id', json.order_id);",
                  "console.log('📦 Order number:', json.order_number);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🔑 V1 OTP",
      "description": "Flujo de identidad por OTP — verifica el email del cliente y emite un JWT.\n\n⚡ /verify captura automáticamente el customer_token en las variables de colección.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/otp/send",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"cart_id\": \"{{cart_id}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/otp/send",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "otp", "send"]
            },
            "description": "Envía código OTP al email del cliente."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/otp/verify ⚡ — captura customer_token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"cart_id\": \"{{cart_id}}\",\n  \"otp_code\": \"123456\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/otp/verify",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "otp", "verify"]
            },
            "description": "Verifica el código OTP.\n\nAl tener éxito:\n- Establece cookie HttpOnly `waro_customer_session` (clientes browser)\n- Retorna `customer_token` en el body (clientes no-browser)\n\nEl script de test guarda automáticamente `customer_token` y `customer_id` en las variables de colección."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.customer_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('customer_token', json.customer_token);",
                  "  console.log('✅ customer_token guardado');",
                  "}",
                  "if (json.customer_id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('customer_id', json.customer_id);",
                  "  console.log('✅ customer_id guardado:', json.customer_id);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('OTP verificado', () => pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/otp/resend",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"cart_id\": \"{{cart_id}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/otp/resend",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "otp", "resend"]
            },
            "description": "Reenvía el código OTP. Cooldown: 60 segundos entre reenvíos."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "👤 V1 Customer",
      "description": "Validación de elegibilidad del cliente para realizar un pedido.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/customer/validate",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"+573001234567\",\n  \"cart_total\": 45000\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/customer/validate",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "customer", "validate"]
            },
            "description": "Verifica si el cliente puede realizar un pedido — blacklist, tier y límites de gasto."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📍 V1 Addresses",
      "description": "Gestión de direcciones de entrega del cliente.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /v1/addresses/preview?email=",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/addresses/preview?email={{test_email}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "addresses", "preview"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "email", "value": "{{test_email}}", "description": "Email del cliente" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Previsualización de direcciones guardadas sin requerir OTP — para el paso de entrega."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/addresses — Crear dirección",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"customer_id\": \"{{customer_id}}\",\n  \"address_line1\": \"Calle 72 # 10-35\",\n  \"address_line2\": \"Apto 301\",\n  \"city\": \"Bogotá\",\n  \"state\": \"Cundinamarca\",\n  \"postal_code\": \"110231\",\n  \"country\": \"CO\",\n  \"latitude\": 4.6547,\n  \"longitude\": -74.0582,\n  \"is_default\": true,\n  \"address_type\": \"home\",\n  \"delivery_notes\": \"Edificio azul, segundo piso\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/addresses",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "addresses"]
            },
            "description": "Crea una dirección de entrega. Máximo 5 por cliente. Si is_default=true, las demás se desmarcan."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.id || json.address_id) {",
                  "  const id = json.id || json.address_id;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('address_id', id);",
                  "  console.log('✅ address_id guardado:', id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /v1/addresses/customer/{customer_id}",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/addresses/customer/{{customer_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "addresses", "customer", "{{customer_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Lista todas las direcciones del cliente, ordenadas por default primero, luego más recientes."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /v1/addresses/{address_id} — Actualizar",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"delivery_notes\": \"Nuevo comentario de entrega\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/addresses/{{address_id}}?customer_id={{customer_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "addresses", "{{address_id}}"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "customer_id", "value": "{{customer_id}}", "description": "Validación de propiedad" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Actualización parcial — solo se modifican los campos enviados."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH /v1/addresses/{address_id}/set-default",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/addresses/{{address_id}}/set-default?customer_id={{customer_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "addresses", "{{address_id}}", "set-default"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "customer_id", "value": "{{customer_id}}", "description": "Validación de propiedad" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Marca esta dirección como predeterminada. Desmarca todas las demás."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /v1/addresses/{address_id}",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/addresses/{{address_id}}?customer_id={{customer_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "addresses", "{{address_id}}"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "customer_id", "value": "{{customer_id}}", "description": "Validación de propiedad" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Elimina la dirección. Si era la default y existen otras, promueve la más reciente."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📊 Sales",
      "description": "Consulta de ventas y métricas del tenant.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/sales — Listar ventas",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"dateFrom\": \"2025-01-01\",\n  \"dateTo\": \"2025-12-31\",\n  \"timezone\": \"America/Bogota\",\n  \"limit\": 20,\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"status\": null,\n  \"paymentMethod\": null,\n  \"sortField\": \"created_at\",\n  \"sortDirection\": \"desc\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
